  eventID: "\" Ng\xF3n tay v\xE0ng \" trong th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n "
  eventName: "\" Ng\xF3n tay v\xE0ng \" trong th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n "
  description: "M\u1ED9t sinh vi\xEAn s\u01A1 h\u1EDF ng\u1EE7 g\u1EE5c v\xE0 b\u1ECB
    m\xF3c m\u1EA5t v\xED ngay trong khu v\u1EF1c t\u1EF1 h\u1ECDc th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n
    T\u1EA1 Quang B\u1EEDu."
